OL,3,GNEWSAForecast shows council facing #6m
OL,4,Aoverspend
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is forecast to be making a
OL,7,Fmultimillion-pound overspend by the end
OL,8,Fof the financial year, according to a
OL,9,Freport.
OL,11,FNewcastle City Council is currently
OL,12,Fexpected to spend #6m more than its
OL,13,Fbudget by March, the Liberal
OL,14,FDemocrat-led authority's routine
OL,15,Fquarterly forecast showed.
OL,17,FHowever, deputy leader Mark Mitchell
OL,18,Fsaid "the numbers will change" as the
OL,19,Fyear continues and "for those that have
OL,20,Fbeen around this for a while, the
OL,21,Fnumbers won't be a huge surprise".
